# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure IBM Quantum credentials {#configure-ibm-quantum-credentials}"
msgstr "Configura las credenciales de IBM Quantum {#configure-ibm-quantum-credentials}"

